/* ------------------------------------------------- right to left (Arabic, 2.6) */
/* The host carries dir (the panel's language, never the page's). Layout uses logical properties; what's left here moves
   along x: the Mac sidebar sits at the left and slides in from there, switches are on at the start side, the back chevron points to
   the start. Code stays left to right in any language. Swipes and the floating button stay physical (a finger's way). */
