`;var lv=`/* Read aloud and the plans sheet (2.6, Ultra). Ultra's colour: violet into blue, next to Pro's sky into blue. */
/* Solid, so its small text reads (white on the gradient's light end was 2.7:1; on --ultra it's 5:1). */
